        "description": "Postnatal growth retardation and short stature",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "hypertension",
        "description": "Systemic hypertension secondary to renal impairment",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of renal dysfunction, skeletal abnormalities, and documented radiation exposure",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical and supported by history and imaging; genetic testing is not contributory."
